What is the output of the following parameterized constructor snippet?
```java
class Point2D {
    int x, y;
    Point2D(int x, int y) {
        this.x = x * 2;
        this.y = y * 2;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Point2D p = new Point2D(3, 4);
        System.out.println(p.x + "," + p.y);
    }
}
```

