What is the output of the following constructor chaining program?
```java
class Step {
    static String trace = "";
    Step(int x) {
        trace += x;
    }
    Step() {
        this(7);
        trace += "done";
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new Step();
        System.out.println(Step.trace);
    }
}
```

What is the output of the following buffer pool program?
```java
class BufferPool {
    int capacity;
    BufferPool(int cap) {
        if (cap <= 0) {
            capacity = 16;
            return;
        }
        capacity = cap;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        BufferPool bp = new BufferPool(-4);
        System.out.println(bp.capacity);
    }
}
```

