What is the output of the following serial generator program?
```java
class RegistryEntry {
    static int globalSerial = 100;
    int serial;
    RegistryEntry() {
        serial = ++globalSerial;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        RegistryEntry e1 = new RegistryEntry();
        RegistryEntry e2 = new RegistryEntry();
        System.out.println(e1.serial + ":" + e2.serial);
    }
}
```

