What is the output of the following program?
```java
class EarlyReturn {
    int val = 5;
    EarlyReturn(boolean stop) {
        if (stop) {
            val = 99;
            return;
        }
        val = 100;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        EarlyReturn er = new EarlyReturn(true);
        System.out.println(er.val);
    }
}
```

